        "text": "<thinking> To handle the OAuth callback and exchange an authorization code for tokens, I will use the Google OAuth 2.0 service as the concrete external provider. This choice is based on the requirement to use a concrete external provider and make it identifiable in the code. The Google OAuth 2.0 service is widely used and well-documented, making it a suitable choice for this task. </thinking>\n",
